rem Lattice Paths
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=15
rem Count right-and-down paths through an
rem N by N grid

use io
use cli

option Size integer = 20

rem Compute the binomial coefficient
rem with reduce. Alternatively:
rem (Size * 2) Size binomial
Num = (Size + 1) to Size * 2 reduce *
Den = 1 to Size reduce *
Answer = Num // Den
Answer print
